Third-Party Assets Notice

This software is a toolkit for Counter-Strike 2 / Source 2 modding and
ships a large number of icons and images taken from Valve's own Source 2
tools (Hammer, Model Doc Editor, Source Filmmaker, the Particle Editor
Tool, Asset Browser, VConsole, Workshop Manager, and others), found under
`Hammer5ToolsGUI/gui/icons/` and `Hammer5ToolsGUI/gui/images/`, as well as
Valve/Counter-Strike 2 branding such as `cs2_icon.jpg`. These icons and
images are the property of Valve Corporation, are used solely for
identification and interoperability with Valve's tools and file formats,
and are NOT covered by the MIT license above. Their inclusion does not
imply endorsement by or affiliation with Valve. All other trademarks are
the property of their respective owners.
